  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So with the open beta update that adds a bunch of the requested features from the feedback before EAC was added, I was excited to see the moveable main menu among one of them.\nOne thing I would recommend is instead of having to move the main menu from the default position every time it opens to have it set so it just opens directly in front of you regardless of your HMD's position.\nFor example, if I am laying down and my headset is facing \"up\", then the main menu should be spawned \"up\" as well in front of my viewpoint. \nIt does become bothersome having to bend my neck down just to move the main menu up, only to have to do again once I close the main menu.",
